@startuml Lihat_Status_Pesanan
!theme plain
title SD: Lihat Status Pesanan
actor Customer
participant "App (Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend" as API
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> App: Tab Pesanan
App -> API: GET /orders/{user_id}
API -> DB: SELECT orders WHERE user_id\nORDER BY id DESC
DB --> API: List pesanan
API --> App: JSON pesanan
App --> Customer: Daftar pesanan\n(ID, total, status, tanggal)

note over App: Refresh otomatis tiap 5 detik\nJika status berubah → tampil notifikasi

Customer -> App: Klik pesanan → Lihat Invoice
App -> API: GET /orders/detail/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT order + items + products
DB --> API: Detail pesanan
API --> App: Item, qty, subtotal, total
App --> Customer: Tampil Invoice lengkap

@enduml
